# unit_dead_08_b467: unit tests of bank $08 code nothing calls or jumps to
# (08:B467-B862, 08:C096-C123, 08:D09E-D149), from the start of a Novice
# race (objects 1, $63, $C5 and $127 have records; object 1 is the
# player, $0346):
# - 08:B467 (a JSR routine) on object 1 (its record's list of four) and
#   08:B48A;
# - 08:B680 on object $189 given children $63, $C5, $127, $1EB in
#   +$2E-+$34: the player $4000 away, $100 ahead, $100 behind and
#   $1000 behind along +$10;
# - 08:B6B8, the second distance's negation no case reaches (the object
#   is behind the player there), entered directly with A = -$100 and
#   -$1000;
# - 08:B782 removing $C5 from the list at $7E:FFBD, removing one not in
#   it, with the count $7E:FFFD at 0 and an empty list, and with the count
#   at 0 and $63 still listed; 08:B7C6;
# - 08:B846 with A = 1, 2 and 3 (player 2 as $63);
# - 08:C096; 08:C097 on object 1: record flags without $0400 (its list
#   +$3E staged as object $63 alone: the code follows each entry's object
#   with ObjectChildFollow, so a record address there does not end) and
#   with $0400;
#   and on object $63 (+$24 bit 3: its parents marked);
# - 08:D09E, 08:D0AC, 08:D0BA, 08:D0C8 and their handler 08:D0DE;
#   08:D0E8 and its handler 08:D0F7 on object $63 with +$29 equal to
#   the player's record's +$58 and not.
